From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenBMC <openbmc@example.com>
Date: Fri, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use Bootstrap 5 CSS variables in custom SCSS

Replace static SCSS function calls (theme-color(), theme-color-light())
with Bootstrap 5 CSS custom properties (var(--bs-*)). These CSS
variables automatically shift for light/dark mode when
$color-mode-type: media-query is set, enabling proper automatic
theme adaptation without hard-coded computed colours.

Mappings applied:
  theme-color('X')       → var(--bs-X)
  theme-color-light('X') → var(--bs-X-bg-subtle)
  theme-color-dark('light') → var(--bs-tertiary-bg)

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [X570D4I-2T board-specific webui-vue theming]

